{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089480/extras/c3201423159e974f6030e5ba6ee98098.avif?t=1704671252\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br>The Wave of Monk\u00e9 is a action-comedy third-person shooter RPG based on the \u201cReject Humanity, Return to Monk\u00e9\u201d meme. The game follows Monk\u00e9, a bored gorilla who wants to become something more\u2026a human. Travel the multiverse with the legendary laser guitar gun that will grant you evolutionary experience points whenever you kill an enemy. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089480/extras/bf53bb4e4104ae7eeae4ad86376189a2.avif?t=1704671252\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br>As you travel the multiverse, you will meet many strange individuals including an ancient gun-blazing Japanese Sensei, a cartel made up of personified versions of letters from the English alphabet, Vietnam war veteran Santa Claus who suffers from alcoholism, an alien nerd, a wizard, and influencer goddess, Satan himself, and more. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089480/extras/426d18213872cf3d3d38c00294ab890c.avif?t=1704671252\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br>W, A, S, D TO MOVE<br><br>RIGHT-CLICK TO AIM, LEFT-CLICK TO SHOOT<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089480/extras/d799c9b642e084a8bcea5677af4785ec.poster.avif?t=1704671252\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089480/extras/d799c9b642e084a8bcea5677af4785ec.webm?t=1704671252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089480/extras/d799c9b642e084a8bcea5677af4785ec.mp4?t=1704671252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>PRESS &quot;G&quot; TO CHUCK UP SOME GRENADES<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089480/extras/02d269e5e5084de4b18321158a4b8616.poster.avif?t=1704671252\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089480/extras/02d269e5e5084de4b18321158a4b8616.webm?t=1704671252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089480/extras/02d269e5e5084de4b18321158a4b8616.mp4?t=1704671252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>PRESS &quot;Q&quot; TO ROLL<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089480/extras/a6bc0ca4021df51106359d224f113e4d.poster.avif?t=1704671252\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089480/extras/a6bc0ca4021df51106359d224f113e4d.webm?t=1704671252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089480/extras/a6bc0ca4021df51106359d224f113e4d.mp4?t=1704671252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>PRESS &quot;X&quot; TO UNLEASH THE ULTIMATE MOVE<br>*unlocked after 2nd level<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089480/extras/37d3b26d85a3d8907fb7ab974b93cefd.poster.avif?t=1704671252\" width=400 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2089480/extras/37d3b26d85a3d8907fb7ab974b93cefd.webm?t=1704671252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam